Note: Inspector will open when selecting from corridor (binding object) — docks right + shift. Combined with center pan both happen — OK.

Hmm — but wait: clicking an object node ON CANVAS in trace mode also triggers centerOnObject — the node is visible already; centering is harmless (slight pan) and arguably good.

4. Also should clicking a corridor chip zoom to at least floor if user had zoomed way out? Keep current zoom — stable map lens principle.

